      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding approximately 1–2 at.% Hf and controlled oxygen during mechanical alloying, followed by SPS near 1150 °C, will form HfO2 precipitates in the MoNbTaW-based matrix.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8510135::web::031::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The resulting HfO2 precipitates will be nanoscale and uniformly dispersed.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HfO2 precipitates will act as non-deformable obstacles that force dislocations to bypass them by Orowan looping.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10708198::web::027::theoretical_analysis_of_precipitation_ha"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide dispersion will pin dislocations.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10708198::web::027::theoretical_analysis_of_precipitation_ha",
        "PMC8510135::web::031::5_conclusions"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The HfO2 precipitates will inhibit irradiation-induced defect-cluster coalescence.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4734288::web::001::body"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide dispersion will preserve a refined grain structure.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Orowan strengthening from the precipitates will increase yield strength and hardness.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
